---
layout: base.njk
title: Контакти
description: Свържете се с нас за консултация, оглед и оферта за фотоволтаична система в Пловдив и региона.
---

<main>
  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-blue/80 mb-2">Контакти</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-blue">Свържете се с нас</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-brand-blue/80 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        Най-бързо става по телефон или Viber. Ако предпочитате — пишете ни на имейл.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        {% from "macros/ui.njk" import icon %}

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-brand-blue/10 bg-brand-buttercream p-6 shadow-sm text-brand-blue">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            {{ icon('phone') }}
            <div class="font-semibold">Телефон</div>
          </div>
          <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phone | replace(' ', '') }}" class="text-brand-blue/90 hover:underline">{{ site.contact.phone }}</a>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-brand-blue/10 bg-brand-buttercream p-6 shadow-sm text-brand-blue">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            {{ icon('mail') }}
            <div class="font-semibold">Имейл</div>
          </div>
          <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}" class="text-brand-blue/90 hover:underline">{{ site.contact.email }}</a>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-brand-blue/10 bg-brand-buttercream p-6 shadow-sm text-brand-blue">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent"></span>
            <div class="font-semibold">Viber</div>
          </div>
          {% if site.contact and site.contact.viber %}
          <a href="viber://chat?number={{ site.contact.viber | replace('+','%2B') }}" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full rounded-2xl bg-brand-accent text-brand-blue font-semibold py-3 px-4 hover:opacity-95 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-blue/30">
            Пиши във Viber
          </a>
          {% else %}
          <div class="text-sm text-brand-blue/70">Добавете Viber номер в `site.config.json`.</div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if site.contact.workingHours %}
          <div class="mt-4 text-sm text-brand-blue/80">Работно време: {{ site.contact.workingHours }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

